Regarding Bob Lazar and S4

"That is enough for me to set the case aside."
"the claims are unsupported, the credentials appear to be fabricated, and the physics is wrong"

What I actually think:
Credentials: Does it matter? Was Parson's credentialed prior to creating the Jet Propulsion laboratory? Was Einstein educated as a math professor prior to his equations?
Claims: In the film created by project gravitaur; Bob decribes a fairly routine ascension through the ranks to eventually end up at S4. First starting at EG&G. It's not all that abnormal that for employees of one company who's contracted to do operations with other government contractors that the workers between them will float around. Get offered roles inside of other departments within the larger framework of the machine. As for the HOW he ended up there its no mystery. What fascinates me is the description of the physics. Bob described a cylindrical shaped black hollow barrel. Made of some kind of metal. When they rotated the barrel 90 degrees it froze time in the room. The flame that was flickering stopped and froze mid-air. A few things that stood out to me: why 90 degrees? thats a vector dot product equation. Thats a perfect 90 degree perpendicular. That proves math went into its design. Whatever its purpose was. The other thing that stood out to me is that it froze time for the candle flame but not for the observers. Perhaps human beings are not as bound to time as we initially thought / assumed.

